WEBVTT

00:00:28.004 --> 00:00:31.988
As you know, we have been living
in New York City since 2015.

00:00:32.385 --> 00:00:35.734
But life has completely changed
over the past year.

00:00:36.243 --> 00:00:39.561
At first, New York City was about museums

00:00:39.585 --> 00:00:40.783
and parks

00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:42.487
and school and friends.

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:45.393
Now it serves as a web

00:00:45.417 --> 00:00:47.673
that connects me with all the other people

00:00:47.697 --> 00:00:49.896
who are organizing to save the planet.

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:52.957
You know how it started for me?

00:00:52.981 --> 00:00:54.885
It was Dad and his wisdom.

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:59.537
Everything you taught him,
he went and taught the world.

00:00:59.561 --> 00:01:04.450
All of his words about
the responsibility that we have as humans